msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- Learn about the [primitive base classes](/guides/primitives) that the IBM Quantum primitives are based on.\n"
"- Review detailed [Estimator](/guides/estimator-examples), [Sampler](/guides/sampler-examples), or [Executor](/guides/executor-examples) examples.\n"
"- See the input and output details for [Estimator](/guides/estimator-input-output), [Executor](/guides/executor-input-output), and [Sampler](/guides/sampler-input-output).\n"
"- Practice with primitives by working through the [Cost function lesson](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) in IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- See the [EstimatorV2 API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/estimator-v2), [SamplerV2 API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/sampler-v2), and [Executor API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/executor).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"המלצות\">\n"
"- למד על [primitives של Qiskit](/guides/primitives) שעליהם מבוססים ה-primitives של Qiskit Runtime.\n"
"- עיין בדוגמאות מפורטות של [Estimator](/guides/estimator-examples), [Sampler](/guides/sampler-examples) או [Executor](/guides/executor-examples).\n"
"- ראה את פרטי הקלט והפלט של [Estimator](/guides/estimator-input-output), [Executor](/guides/executor-input-output) ו-[Sampler](/guides/sampler-input-output).\n"
"- התאמן עם primitives דרך [שיעור פונקציית העלות](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) ב-IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- ראה את [עזרי API של EstimatorV2](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/estimator-v2), [עזרי API של SamplerV2](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/sampler-v2) ו-[עזרי API של Executor](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/executor).\n"
"- קרא את [מעבר ל-V2 primitives](/guides/v2-primitives).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
